Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:11:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix GHSA-wg4p-4hqh-c3g9: XML_OPTION_SKIP_TAGSTART
 out-of-bounds read

xml_parser_set_option(XML_OPTION_SKIP_TAGSTART) with a value larger
than a tag name made the parser read past the name.

Backport of php-src 0e715e71d9 (Niels Dossche), Sury's 7.4 patch 0114.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
