OK/EOF, auth response, change user, caching_sha2 and sha256 key
responses, result set header, field metadata, prepare response, binary
row date/time/string fields) so a hostile server cannot make them read
past the packet. Upstream calls
the fix partial; the tests expect warnings instead of exceptions.

Backport of php-src 114dbb7436 (Jakub Zelenka, Nora Dossche), Sury's
7.4 patches 0148, 0149 and 0150 (Remi Collet's test changes).

